label Greeting
[Character]: [Scene-specific story dialogue.]
[Character]: [Ask for item dynamically using {Transaction.ItemWants} or {Transaction.ItemWantsBest}]
- [player accepts request dialogue]
	[Character]: [Character nods / accepts waiting]
[end_timeline]
label Talk
[Character]: [Restates what they are waiting for, using {Transaction.ItemWants}]
- Coming right up.
	[Character]: [Reaction]
	[end_timeline]
- Sorry, we're out of stock.
	[Character]: [Lore-appropriate exit line]
	[signal arg="refuse_service"]
	[end_timeline]
label Satisfy
if {Transaction.WantsDebt}:
	[Character]: [Debt dialogue]
	- Of course.
		[signal arg="utang_accepted"]
		[Character]: Salamat! [More story dialogue reacting to getting the item...]
	- Take Away Items
		[signal arg="utang_rejected"]
		[Character]: Oh... Next time then.
else:
	[Character]: [More story dialogue reacting to getting the item or thanking the player...]
[end_timeline]
label WrongItem
[Character]: [in-character dialogue telling the player it's the wrong item]
[Character]: [reiterating {Transaction.ItemWants} or {Transaction.ItemWantsBest} in-character]
[end_timeline]